      "cause": "Settings and game passed. News and article ended failed while runtime state remained executing_tools. News model transport recorded 15 responses, all HTTP 200 ending at eof. Accumulated saveTurn data exceeded the 65536-byte host header limit; the legacy decoder rejected the JSON before extracting requestId, causing an uncorrelated error and a 185-second pending RPC timeout.",
